 ## 운영상 중요한 점
 
 쇼핑몰 검색 HTML과 접근 정책은 외부 서비스 변경에 따라 깨질 수 있습니다. CAPTCHA/접근통제 우회는 구현하지 않았습니다. Provider별 파서를 독립시켜 변경 시 해당 Provider만 수정하도록 설계했습니다.
+
+## v0.2.0 changes (2026-08-21)
+- Retailer lookup is now hybrid: direct HTTP parsing plus hidden Android WebView rendering fallback for Gmarket, LotteON, Hmall, and HiMart. This is intended to recover product links/prices from JS-rendered retailer search pages without requiring a Vercel API.
+- Search results are deduplicated to the cheapest exact-SKU offer per retailer (maximum four retailer rows).
+- History is deduplicated by normalized product code. Reopening/researching the same product updates the existing history row and moves it to the top instead of creating duplicates.
+- History stores the original capture time separately from the latest view time. UI format: `2026.08.20(목) 00:00`.
